Maintainer decision required before a public alpha release
==========================================================

Reasonable choices include:

1. GPL-3.0-or-later, if derivative distributions should remain under the same
   license and provide corresponding source.
2. MPL-2.0, if file-level copyleft is preferred while allowing combination
   with differently licensed work.
3. Apache-2.0, if a permissive license with an express patent grant is
   preferred.
4. MIT, if a short permissive license without an express patent grant is
   preferred.

The maintainer should review bundled artwork provenance and third-party brand
usage separately from the code license. Replace this notice with the complete
chosen license text only after that decision is recorded.
